# Vulnerabilities infra/security/scan.sh does not fail on, one per line, each with the reason it is
# safe to ship. An entry with no reason, or one that outlives its reason, is a defect. Empty means
# every finding with a fix was taken by upgrading.
#
# Format:   CVE-YYYY-NNNN   # why it does not apply here, and what would make it apply
